uts","r":"management","s":"Robert Packer","x":"Our largest cost savings were on water service-related expenses, which were $3.3 million, down from $6.8 million in the prior year’s quarter, a decrease of 51.4%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TPL 2021 Q1","e":"tpl","d":"2021-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Packer","x":"In addition, we continue to see cost savings due to our capital spend on electrifying our water sourcing infrastructure.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TPL 2021 Q2","e":"tpl","d":"2021-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ty Glover","x":"TPL continued efforts to electrify our water operations and we expect to realize cost savings and reduce our emissions once completed.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TPL 2021 Q2","e":"tpl","d":"2021-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris Steddum","x":"The increase was primarily due to $4.7 million related to severance costs, partially offset by a decrease of $1.5 million in legal expenses and professional fees.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TPL 2021 Q4","e":"tpl","d":"2022-02-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ty Glover","x":"Commodity prices also steadily improved throughout 2021, with TPL's full year 2021 all-in average commodity price realization over 80% higher than 2020 realization.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TPL 2022 Q4","e":"tpl","d":"2023-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Derrick Whitfield","x":"Meaning new acreage dedications that you wouldn't have had otherwise, or really simply just facilitate bpx's ability to grow by streamlining the processes.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TPL 2023 Q4","e":"tpl","d":"2024-02-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ty Glover","x":"We invest approximately $5 million to $10 million annually towards various growth and cost savings initiatives, with each project individually assessed to determine economics as we continue to explore various opportunities and ideas to enhance our business.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TPL 2024 Q3","e":"tpl","d":"2024-11-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Derrick Whitfield","x":"Given that you guys own one of the largest surface acre spreads in Texas, could you speak to the level of non-oil and gas revenue you're generating to date and the potential you see in opportunities surrounding AI, data centers, renewable energy, crypto mining, et cetera?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TPL 2025 Q4","e":"tpl","d":"2026-02-19","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Tyler Glover","x":"This past December, we announced a strategic investment into Bolt Data & Energy, a new AI infrastructure platform chaired by former Google CEO, Eric Schmidt.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/texas-pacific-land-tpl-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TPL 2025 Q4","e":"tpl","d":"2026-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tyler Glover","x":"We believe this will substantially reduce the amount of time and cycles produced water needs to pass through the system, thereby providing substantial capital cost and operating expense savings for a commercial-scale facility.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/texas-pacific-land-tpl-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TPL 2026 Q1","e":"tpl","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tyler Glover","x":"Our oil price realization last year averaged $65 per barrel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/tpl-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[45,1,4532,0,0,0,3466,873],[46,1,3052,0,0,0,2241,367],[47,1,4032,0,0,0,3114,674